*> Recursive fib(35) in GnuCOBOL (free format): a RECURSIVE program with local storage, its
*> result returned through RETURN-CODE.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. fibmain.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 N   PIC S9(18) COMP-5 VALUE 35.
01 R   PIC S9(18) COMP-5.
01 OUT PIC Z(17)9.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    CALL "fib" USING BY VALUE N
    MOVE RETURN-CODE TO R
    MOVE R TO OUT
    DISPLAY FUNCTION TRIM(OUT)
    MOVE 0 TO RETURN-CODE
    STOP RUN.
END PROGRAM fibmain.

IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. fib RECURSIVE.
DATA DIVISION.
LOCAL-STORAGE SECTION.
01 A PIC S9(18) COMP-5.
01 M PIC S9(18) COMP-5.
LINKAGE SECTION.
01 K PIC S9(18) COMP-5.
PROCEDURE DIVISION USING BY VALUE K.
    IF K < 2
        MOVE K TO RETURN-CODE
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    COMPUTE M = K - 1
    CALL "fib" USING BY VALUE M
    MOVE RETURN-CODE TO A
    COMPUTE M = K - 2
    CALL "fib" USING BY VALUE M
    COMPUTE RETURN-CODE = A + RETURN-CODE
    GOBACK.
END PROGRAM fib.
